{
  "headline": "FDA's shortage list shows Fresenius Kabi and Hikma propranolol hydrochloride injection short since 2023-10-31; our supply traces to Bryant Ranch Prepack (FEI 1000519407) which received an OAI classification in 2009 and VAI inspections through 2026-07-16",
  "headline_cites": ["E17", "E15", "E16", "E14", "E4", "E12"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA first posted the propranolol hydrochloride injection shortage on 2023-10-31 for Fresenius Kabi USA, LLC and Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA, Inc., and both remain Current as of the 2026-10-15 and 2026-10-14 updates.",
      "cites": ["E17", "E15", "E16"]
    },
    {
      "text": "As of 2026-10-21 the shortage has been on FDA's list for 36 months.",
      "cites": ["D8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Our Corvale East and Corvale General stock both carry NDC 71335236909 labeled by Bryant Ranch Prepack (FEI 1000519407).",
      "cites": ["E1", "E2", "E14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 590126 at that FEI ended 2009-06-11 and was classified OAI with six observations including lack of a written stability program.",
      "cites": ["E4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Subsequent inspections at the same FEI were classified VAI, most recently inspection 1326578 ending 2026-07-16 with classification letter 2026-10-14.",
      "cites": ["E5", "E6", "E7", "E8", "E9", "E10", "E11", "E12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 7 days on hand and Corvale General has 29 days on hand; the rule-ranked transfer of 81 units from General to East would bring East to 14 days while General retains two weeks.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Alternate manufacturers A-S Medication Solutions and AMICI PHARMACEUTICALS LLC are not on FDA's shortage list today and their labels name no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D6", "D7"]
    }
  ]
}
